    {
      "bbox": [
        101,
        1149,
        1990,
        1494
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, since 1960, the Triborough Bridge and Tunnel Authority and since 1961, the above mentioned Libraries, with the approval of the City, have provided, for successive periods of one State fiscal year (except for a shorter period in the 1960-1961 year) pursuant to statutes enacted by the State Legislature, an increased take-home-pay-plan applicable to officers and employees of such Authority and Libraries who are members of the New York State Employees' Retirement System; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.334,
          "min": -1.4997
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 107,
          "mean": -0.0037,
          "min": -0.2392
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12672,
        "area_px": 594732,
        "density": 0.02131,
        "chars": 484,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 38.19
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        101,
        1540,
        1990,
        1744
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, such plan makes possible a decrease in the pension con-\ntributions of such officers and employees without diminution or loss of\npension rights, with the result that the take-home-pay of such officers\nand employees is increased; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2457,
          "min": -1.4139
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 51,
          "mean": -0.0114,
          "min": -0.5576
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7370,
        "area_px": 352054,
        "density": 0.02093,
        "chars": 240,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 32.56
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        101,
        1777,
        2000,
        2037
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, by reason of the economic benefits conferred by such\nplan on such personnel, their morale, efficiency and productiveness are\nimproved, with resulting substantial benefits to the functioning of the\nAuthority and such Libraries, and enhancement of the welfare of the people\nof the City; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2635,
          "min": -1.6312
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 59,
          "mean": -0.0053,
          "min": -0.2746
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7315,
        "area_px": 450378,
        "density": 0.01624,
        "chars": 297,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 40.6
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        101,
        2070,
        2000,
        2230
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, by Laws 1966, Ch. 114, the State Legislature has authorized a continuation of such increased-take-home-pay plan during the 1966-1967 fiscal year of the State; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2336,
          "min": -1.1771
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
